# Meanders Guide: "you may tap another untapped Merfolk". Bot1 chooses no card, so nothing is tapped and the reflexive ability
# never triggers: Ornithopter stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Meanders Guide
Merfolk of the Pearl Trident
Ornithopter
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

